{"type":"elementor","siteurl":"https://bluewhaledental.com/wp-json/","elements":[{"id":"c5033d3","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"presets_options":"preset-4","tabs":[{"question":"Which orthodontic treatment is right for me?","answer":"<div class=\"faq-item active\"><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"faq-answer-inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The best treatment depends on your alignment needs, bite concerns, lifestyle, and goals. During your consultation, our Midtown Manhattan team will evaluate your smile and recommend options such as Invisalign®, traditional braces, retainers, or pediatric orthodontic care.</span></p></div></div></div>","_id":"f1fd89a","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"question":"How much does orthodontic treatment cost in NYC?","answer":"<div class=\"faq-item active\"><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"faq-answer-inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Costs vary depending on the treatment type, complexity of your case, and length of treatment. We provide a personalized treatment plan and review estimated costs before you begin care.</span></p></div></div></div>","_id":"c25ad7f","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"question":"Is orthodontic treatment painful?","answer":"<div class=\"faq-item active\"><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"faq-answer-inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most patients experience mild pressure or temporary discomfort after starting aligners or after braces adjustments. This usually improves within a few days. Our team will guide you on how to stay comfortable throughout treatment.</span></p></div></div></div>","_id":"18fa247","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"_id":"fd851e5","question":"Do you treat both adults and children?","answer":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. We offer orthodontic care for adults, teens, and children, including Invisalign®, braces, retainers, and early pediatric orthodontic evaluations.</span></p>","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"_id":"b738c23","question":"How long does orthodontic treatment take?","answer":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Treatment length depends on your specific needs and chosen treatment. Invisalign® and braces may take several months to a couple of years depending on the case. We’ll provide a personalized timeline during your consultation.</span></p>","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"_id":"bc20004","question":"Is Invisalign® better than braces?","answer":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Invisalign® is a great option for many mild to moderate alignment concerns and is popular because it is removable and discreet. Braces may be better for more complex cases. Your consultation will determine which option fits your needs.</span></p>","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"_id":"67852f3","question":"Do I need a retainer after Invisalign® or braces?","answer":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Retainers help maintain your new alignment and reduce the risk of teeth shifting after treatment.</span></p>","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"question":"When should my child have an orthodontic evaluation?","answer":"<div class=\"faq-item active\"><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"faq-answer-inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many children benefit from an orthodontic evaluation around age 7, when permanent teeth begin coming in and jaw growth can be assessed.</span></p></div></div></div>","_id":"ea2eb12","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"},{"question":"Why choose Blue Whale Dental for orthodontics in Midtown Manhattan?","answer":"<section id=\"faqs\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"faq-max-width\"><div class=\"faq-list\"><div class=\"faq-item active\"><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"faq-answer-inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blue Whale Dental combines personalized treatment planning, modern digital technology, comfort-focused care, and a convenient Midtown Manhattan location to help patients of all ages achieve healthier, more confident smiles.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>","_id":"aa4614e","faq_content_type":"content","ct_saved_rows":"-1","ct_saved_container":"-1","ct_saved_modules":"-1","ct_page_templates":"-1"}],"enable_toggle_layout":"","row_gap":{"unit":"px","size":13,"sizes":[]},"enable_seperator":"","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-angle-down","library":"fa-solid"},"icon_align":"right","uael_box_border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"1","right":"1","bottom":"1","left":"1","isLinked":true},"uael_box_border_color":"#ECF2F6","uael_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"heading_tag":"h4","title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"Playfair Display","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"700","title_typography_line_height":{"unit":"px","size":29,"sizes":[]},"title_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"content_typography_typography":"custom","content_typography_font_family":"Outfit","content_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"content_typography_font_weight":"400","uael_content_padding":{"unit":"px","to